ind":"announcement","title":"100 wishlists. Thank you!","summary":"Hello everyone! Motel 51: Papers, Keys & Aliens has passed its first 100 Steam wishlists! I missed the exact moment by one: the counter is at 101. To everyone who added the game to their wishlist, shared the page, or stopped by to meet the guests: thank you. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46486260/4a84e2bbbf3f3d797bf398f309f2d1d00601e9ae.png I'd love to hear which guest caught your eye, or what you'd like me to show next. Leave a comment here or start a discussion in the Community Hub. Thanks for being here","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:24:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4664250-1846651706678766","game_id":"steam-4664250","kind":"announcement","title":"The Motel 51 demo is available now","summary":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664250/3106b91c9e92c4e65452010e9d12213086488097/header.jpg The free Motel 51 demo is available now on Steam. Your uncle left you a motel near Area 51. The bank left you a deadline. At the night desk, travelers bring IDs, transit permits and stories that do not always agree. Read the details, decide who gets a key and choose a room. Tomorrow's ledger will reflect the choices you made tonight. Try the demo: Motel 51 Demo on Steam ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:40:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678766","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4664250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:06Z","error_codes":[]